      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T21:20:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was under the impression automerger should take care of this. Have a look at http://ag/28648321, it seems the change landed to aosp then merged to other branches. Any reason not to be doing that here? Is it because of the additional presubmits on internal? That shouldn\u0027t matter in this case as this is basically dead code from the presubmit perspective.",
