      "side": 1,
      "message": "I got answer from Chris Forbes and other people that if the code added is not sensitive, it is fine to do it in aosp first.",
      "parentUuid": "153cdb6f_85bdd4a5",
      "revId": "0ec33d71473d74a8c94f5e6615c7a2ec82eac72f",
