      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T23:08:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Yes, I think your understanding is correct. Any issues with that?\n\nThank you for clarifying.\n\nDo you think the better way is to figure out the namespace problem https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/371356548#comment21? I am fine with this being a temporary solution, but I think the fact that 1. and 3. are happening can still lead to confusion.",
      "parentUuid": "bdc5ce01_8d2916fa",
      "revId": "0ec33d71473d74a8c94f5e6615c7a2ec82eac72f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
